// go.work ties the two Go modules in this repository together so a
// single `go build ./...` or `go test ./...` from the repository root
// builds and tests both the engine (core/) and the developer tools
// (tools/).
//
// This is a Go workspace file, not a Go module. It is checked in so
// that a fresh clone is immediately buildable without the contributor
// having to run `go work init` themselves.
//
// Do NOT add a module here that is not checked into this repository;
// go.work is a repository-local convenience, not a dependency
// manifest. Module versions are pinned in each module's own go.mod.
go 1.22

use (
	./core
	./tools
)